<title>Wall steel and annular pile rings</title>
<description>Fixed scalar units: inches, kip, ksi, with density in kip/ft^3 and areas per foot as labeled. Units are labels, not native dimensional quantities. This sheet recomputes the exported topology. Regenerate after changing pile/row counts, bar size/coating, automatic spacing, or contact assumptions. Two continuous top/bottom fillets. Values are not design acceptance. Case 21a9880de0ba.</description>
